  "notes": "Williams System 9 Test 03 (switch test) per the Space Shuttle instruction manual p13: the credits display shows 03 and the ball-in-play display shows the number of each switch the ROM sees closed. Each public switch 1-64 is closed alone for 600 ms with a snapshot taken while held, so the displayed number can be paired with the public address that was driven. Direct switch writes only. Run from an NVRAM initialized by one prior empty-NVRAM power-up.",
